[129]={["atomIDs"]={"129:description:25-212","129:description:217-303","129:description:306-360","129:objective:1-37","129:objective:40-80"},["opening"]="Darcy had prepared lunch for Guard Parker, whose patrol followed the road toward Duskwood. The road was too dangerous for her to carry it herself, even though the man waiting there was well armed.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to carry Parker's lunch to his patrol.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Darcy's lunch to Guard Parker.",["sourceHash"]="83ffed488e627b37c6f6aa8d512a2128908afdc36d25c4f8690afcd804c1d41f",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[130]={["atomIDs"]={"130:description:1-67","130:description:70-151","130:description:156-261","130:objective:1-51"},["opening"]="Parker wanted flowers sent back to Darcy. Lakeshire's herbalist could supply them, but the guard asked that Martie Jainrose hear neither the sender's name nor the intended recipient's.",["pending"]="{actor} would visit Martie Jainrose about the flowers.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Martie Jainrose about a bouquet.",["sourceHash"]="801b86e17b95b0a0429985cf52bdb4336cae6fee04d2c06567f8364f6a718c40",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[131]={["aftermath"]="Darcy admired the flowers before recognizing Martie's favorite. Her suspicion of jealousy, even poisoning, remained an anxious accusation rather than an established fact.",["atomIDs"]={"131:description:1-21","131:description:24-49","131:description:52-71","131:objective:1-32"},["availabilityQualification"]={["basis"]="Catalog states positive beta server experience; confirms reported definition, not that a player can reach its giver in the target release",["currentServerPlayableConfirmed"]=false,["eligibility"]="BETA_SERVER_DEFINED_PUBLISHER_CLAIM",["sourceReceipt"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639 ; https://tierhall.app/wow/quests/131 ; https://warcraftforever.games/quests/131 ; https://wowfwiki.com/wiki/Quests"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"131:completion:1-21","131:completion:23-61","131:completion:66-107","131:completion:109-181","131:completion:183-229","131:completion:231-292","131:completion:297-324","131:completion:326-357"},["opening"]="Martie selected daffodils for the waiting bouquet because they were her favorite. The flowers were meant for Darcy, who still awaited their delivery.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to give the Daffodil Bouquet to Darcy.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Daffodil Bouquet to Darcy.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="bbd4a3f61452930d6f38dd279640da0661a13742d2568562110c69add1e1eaa3",["sourceMapID"]="1433",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[133]={["atomIDs"]={"133:description:1-106","133:description:109-193","133:description:198-257","133:description:260-293","133:description:296-392","133:objective:1-63"},["opening"]="Abercrombie claimed that Bone Chewers had been battering his remote house. He proposed an effigy to frighten off ghouls and asked for seven ribs from the walking dead to build it.",["pending"]="{actor} would collect seven Ghoul Ribs for Abercrombie's effigy.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied Abercrombie with seven Ghoul Ribs.",["sourceHash"]="2747f099c75fd0607c17cb34aacda2d6d1e00a24aeee9f3ed270c6def3cb4cdc",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[134]={["atomIDs"]={"134:description:1-87","134:description:90-165","134:description:170-259","134:description:262-307","134:description:312-371","134:objective:1-42"},["opening"]="Abercrombie said ogres drove him from his herb gathering and left him without a crate of tools and herbs. He believed the crate remained near their mound in southern Duskwood.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover Abercrombie's Crate from the ogre mound.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned Abercrombie's Crate to him.",["sourceHash"]="41177fab7e8854bad1c1a1d816f917752624419a416987d2f9e717c9f98c258c",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[136]={["aftermath"]="A crab among the sand and water carried another clue from the footlocker.",["atomIDs"]={"136:description:1-78","136:description:81-142","136:description:148-183","136:description:186-282","136:description:285-351","136:description:354-396","136:description:399-430","136:objective:1-65"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"136:completion:1-34","136:completion:36-79","136:completion:81-89","136:completion:91-157"},["opening"]="Captain Sanders's message promised treasure to whoever could follow his clues after his death. A rusty anchor among Westfall's coastal wrecks marked the way to a sand-buried footlocker and the next part of the trail.",["pending"]="{actor} would search for the footlocker beside the rusty anchor.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} found Captain Sanders's footlocker.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceHash"]="5eae480345d75a56650d8495778519e389ba25af3b7f98900d0e1c8dedaa522a",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[138]={["atomIDs"]={"138:description:1-49","138:description:52-80","138:description:83-119","138:description:122-178","138:description:181-232","138:objective:1-77"},["bridge"]="The footlocker's clue directed the search east, up the bluffs and toward the road. An old barrel near ruined chimney masonry was the next landmark in Sanders's directions.",["bridgeFrom"]=136,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["opening"]="The footlocker's clue directed the search east, up the bluffs and toward the road. An old barrel near ruined chimney masonry was the next landmark in Sanders's directions.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to search the barrel beside the ruined chimney.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} found the next clue in the old barrel.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceHash"]="f8aa94767b507acad0670fc349a7c17ec2bb9faaa8e4d145721fbccb6ceaa17a",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[139]={["atomIDs"]={"139:description:1-69","139:description:72-129","139:description:132-246","139:description:249-319","139:objective:1-60"},["bridge"]="From the barrel, Sanders's directions turned north. A lone windmill on the sea bluffs and an empty jug would mark the next hiding place along the trail.",["bridgeFrom"]=138,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["opening"]="From the barrel, Sanders's directions turned north. A lone windmill on the sea bluffs and an empty jug would mark the next hiding place along the trail.",["pending"]="{actor} would follow the bluffs to the jug beside the windmill.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} found the clue hidden in the old jug.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceHash"]="6c407bb087cf07035c1b602473313e0d9d15e2b4e69e49afa921121d9b92fe63",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[140]={["atomIDs"]={"140:description:1-80","140:description:83-255","140:description:258-315","140:description:318-354","140:description:357-423","140:objective:1-58"},["bridge"]="Whiskey-scented parchment gave the final direction from the jug: west to the shore, then into the sea toward an island. Somewhere there, Sanders's chest waited at the end of the search.",["bridgeFrom"]=139,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["opening"]="Whiskey-scented parchment gave the final direction from the jug: west to the shore, then into the sea toward an island. Somewhere there, Sanders's chest waited at the end of the search.",["pending"]="{actor} would seek Captain Sanders's chest on the island.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached and opened Captain Sanders's chest.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceHash"]="a79f38e684818e81b03206f520000688b41213603cfb37b4cedcaf70173393a2",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[143]={["atomIDs"]={"143:description:1-47","143:description:50-92","143:description:95-134","143:description:137-242","143:description:245-302","143:description:307-356","143:description:359-441","143:objective:1-87"},["opening"]="Lakeshire could not wait indefinitely for Stormwind's army. Solomon turned to the people's militia forming in Westfall, hoping Gryan Stoutmantle could spare support before the king's reserves arrived.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to carry Solomon's written plea to Gryan Stoutmantle.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Solomon's plea to Stoutmantle in Westfall.",["sourceHash"]="d4884feac081e6479bfecf8f23f64ba946d6c037059643596a702bd5d28a5e92",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[144]={["atomIDs"]={"144:description:1-43","144:description:46-176","144:description:179-263","144:description:268-317","144:description:320-385","144:objective:1-63"},["opening"]="Stoutmantle described a Westfall fighting its own war without Stormwind's aid. His militia could not supply the relief Lakeshire sought, and his reply had to carry that refusal back to Solomon.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to return Stoutmantle's response to Solomon.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Gryan Stoutmantle's response to Magistrate Solomon.",["sourceHash"]="f2127a3c0763b16554b97f1790040625b7258f5ed4135ad41da77b6b2a4aec77",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[145]={["atomIDs"]={"145:description:1-37","145:description:40-168","145:description:171-224","145:description:227-260","145:description:263-324","145:description:327-354","145:objective:1-77"},["opening"]="Solomon now appealed to Darkshire's Night Watch. His letter asked Lord Ebonlocke to send trained guards for Lakeshire's defense, though the road to that hoped-for aid ran through Duskwood.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to take Solomon's letter to Lord Ebonlocke in Darkshire.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Solomon's letter to Lord Ello Ebonlocke.",["sourceHash"]="4a273b42ffb4144de6b7e7bbe62a898ac4f2576a7d085ce3ba0758716b56bc1c",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[146]={["atomIDs"]={"146:description:1-82","146:description:85-148","146:description:151-245","146:description:248-357","146:description:362-418","146:objective:1-70"},["opening"]="Ebonlocke said the Night Watch existed because Stormwind abandoned Darkshire. Sending it away would expose the town to the very evil it was formed to resist; his response returned another limit on Lakeshire's hopes.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to carry Ebonlocke's response to Solomon.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Lord Ebonlocke's letter of response to Magistrate Solomon.",["sourceHash"]="67aa1d4fcbe03279757f63f2f3c0b4aa89f8d722adfebbcb7c202cdf338abd68",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[147]={["aftermath"]="Dughan recognized a Stonemasons' Guild membership ring. Why a thief carried it, and why Defias thieves wanted mine gold, remained open questions.",["atomIDs"]={"147:description:1-85","147:description:88-186","147:description:189-239","147:description:244-328","147:description:331-362","147:objective:1-87"},["bridge"]="The schedule suggested that the Collector was taking gold that belonged to the kingdom. Dughan wanted the thief at Brackwell brought to justice, and the ring mentioned in the notes might reveal whom he served.",["bridgeFrom"]=123,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"147:completion:1-14","147:completion:16-29","147:completion:31-83","147:completion:88-128","147:completion:130-196","147:completion:198-312","147:completion:317-336","147:completion:338-371"},["opening"]="The schedule suggested that the Collector was taking gold that belonged to the kingdom. Dughan wanted the thief at Brackwell brought to justice, and the ring mentioned in the notes might reveal whom he served.",["pending"]="{actor} would confront the Collector and bring the ring to Dughan.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the Collector's ring to the marshal.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceHash"]="e0d13fb15b9e74add2124ba1441c6ad31cc94efb37dbb3a3ccc0b722602de8fd",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[148]={["atomIDs"]={"148:description:36-160","148:description:165-229","148:description:232-298","148:objective:1-22"},["opening"]="Abercrombie said age and distance kept him from making the journey to Darkshire. He asked for Ghost Hair Thread from Madame Eva, whose home stood on the village square.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to ask Madame Eva about Ghost Hair Thread.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought Abercrombie's request for thread to Madame Eva.",["sourceHash"]="88b33a340655ede9dff17a1013693cb931ce210b65996ccc61ff96ed939b8a89",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[149]={["atomIDs"]={"149:description:1-102","149:description:107-172","149:description:175-264","149:description:269-326","149:objective:1-38"},["opening"]="Madame Eva knew where ghost hair might be found: Blind Mary haunted a farmhouse in the hills south of Darkshire. A Spectral Comb could gather the strands, though Eva warned of dark things near the house.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to take the Spectral Comb to Blind Mary.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the Spectral Comb to Blind Mary.",["sourceHash"]="00c9c415b9be3cfefc2e7e46e52fa19e3351787b442be58dedace8e72ac5fe0f",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[150]={["atomIDs"]={"150:description:1-31","150:description:34-140","150:description:143-201","150:description:206-218","150:description:221-286","150:objective:1-53"},["opening"]="Baren saw growing groups of murlocs fishing Lake Everstill and feared for its stock. He asked for eight fins in an effort to curb the poachers along the shore.",["pending"]="{actor} would obtain eight Murloc Fins for Baren.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered eight Murloc Fins to Dockmaster Baren.",["sourceHash"]="6817ad7127f704e9c841434c3a9e3141fd7c093b6186a2ad59d9b26762e3af4e",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[151]={["atomIDs"]={"151:description:1-17","151:description:20-76","151:description:78-162","151:description:164-242","151:description:247-380","151:description:382-423","151:objective:1-69"},["opening"]="A broken wagon had delayed the Furlbrows longer than expected, leaving old Blanchy hungry after the journey. Verna asked for oats from Westfall's fields, where the harvest machines made a simple errand less safe.",["pending"]="{actor} would gather eight handfuls of oats for Blanchy.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied Verna with the oats for Blanchy.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceHash"]="6d1dd7059fbd1e87af510d42156c664df285b993f8d85e279919ea5a123e797e",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[152]={["aftermath"]="Grayson judged the coast safer after the fighting, while the Great Sea remained dangerous.",["atomIDs"]={"152:description:1-59","152:description:62-97","152:description:100-209","152:description:212-242","152:description:247-350","152:objective:1-118"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"152:completion:1-14","152:completion:16-49","152:completion:51-103"},["opening"]="Sailors surviving the wrecks still needed somewhere safe to come ashore. Grayson's concern reached beyond the lighthouse to the murlocs occupying Westfall's beaches.",["pending"]="{actor} would confront the tidehunters, warriors, oracles and coastrunners along the coast.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} fulfilled Grayson's charge against the coastal murlocs.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceHash"]="fe3787a42c571ccc9b20ffa6feb4c82abcc7ceab9ba4ba62cef9406bbd4ded70",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[153]={["atomIDs"]={"153:description:1-40","153:description:43-102","153:description:105-220","153:description:225-290","153:objective:1-64"},["opening"]="Galiaan had followed the Defias as their front shifted across Westfall. Their red leather bandanas offered one means of tracking the gang's movement and resistance around the militia's position.",["pending"]="{actor} would gather fifteen Defias bandanas for Scout Galiaan.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the bandanas to Galiaan at Sentinel Hill.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceHash"]="e2c9dfd77bbd55ecf663de20373d7345516d68311da76a37c5b26d789b18080e",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[154]={["aftermath"]="The comb carried enough hair for Madame Eva to make the requested thread, with strands remaining beyond that need.",["atomIDs"]={"154:description:12-48","154:description:53-110","154:objective:1-54"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"154:completion:1-83","154:completion:85-128"},["opening"]="Blind Mary wanted the comb taken away. Her distress left the errand unfinished: the Ghost Hair Comb had to return to Madame Eva in Darkshire.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to return the Ghost Hair Comb to Madame Eva.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the Ghost Hair Comb to Madame Eva.",["sourceHash"]="a899530c5b2c27109fc3918734b2b125830b57093340962d79fa75546c020b91",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[156]={["atomIDs"]={"156:description:1-81","156:description:86-121","156:description:124-223","156:description:225-266","156:description:271-324","156:objective:1-71"},["opening"]="Smitts could brew Zombie Juice if supplied with eight Rot Blossoms. He had heard that they grew inside the skulls of Raven Hill's skeletal fiends and horrors, joining a tavern errand to the dangers crowding the cemetery.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to gather eight Rot Blossoms for Smitts.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought eight Rot Blossoms to Tavernkeep Smitts.",["sourceHash"]="a28cb6b1c6106e12c9e554f2af876b4184607282743fa3e3337a7c203a4c2f80",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[157]={["atomIDs"]={"157:description:1-24","157:description:27-114","157:objective:1-90"},["opening"]="Madame Eva had prepared the thread. She described uses ranging from binding spirits to giving life to inanimate things; for now, the spool was bound for Abercrombie's shack north of Raven Hill Cemetery.",["pending"]="{actor} would deliver the Ghost Hair Thread to Abercrombie.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Ghost Hair Thread to Abercrombie.",["sourceHash"]="6adf75e227b2602722febbd0314a4beaa965d94538054c59af361529657e6854",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[158]={["atomIDs"]={"158:description:1-51","158:description:54-129","158:description:134-154","158:description:157-231","158:objective:1-29"},["opening"]="Abercrombie's next request was Zombie Juice, a liquor he said would warm him through Duskwood's cold nights. Tavernkeep Smitts at the Scarlet Raven was the suggested supplier.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to ask Smitts for Zombie Juice.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the request for Zombie Juice to Tavernkeep Smitts.",["sourceHash"]="34fb2c6153b45a7ada30f214ff22b7740e5542c758b83818c6320ea342865dee",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[159]={["atomIDs"]={"159:description:1-27","159:description:32-65","159:description:68-104","159:objective:1-51"},["opening"]="The bottle of Zombie Juice was ready for Abercrombie. Smitts cautioned that it was extraordinarily strong; the delivery returned to the isolated shack with that warning attached.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to carry the Zombie Juice to Abercrombie.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Zombie Juice to Abercrombie at his shack.",["sourceHash"]="818e311c57a650c193cf7beac175466b1cc4d1c1f62c4346c6f78d168a079077",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[160]={["atomIDs"]={"160:description:1-57","160:description:62-185","160:objective:1-65"},["opening"]="Abercrombie entrusted a note to Darkshire's mayor. He called Ello Ebonlocke an old friend and promised that the account of the favors done for him would please the mayor.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to take Abercrombie's Letter to Mayor Ello Ebonlocke.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Abercrombie's Letter to Lord Ello Ebonlocke.",["sourceHash"]="260ae122449e942b529aa11c489fdf4297756ddec1c0b7a38dd27fc589ee62bd",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[161]={["atomIDs"]={"161:description:1-68","161:description:71-161","161:description:164-249","161:description:252-303","161:description:308-411","161:description:414-469","161:objective:1-128"},["opening"]="Hinderweir suspected an explosive but needed expert analysis. Ashlan Stonesmirk, assigned to the defense of Dun Modr and the Thandol Span, was the specialist he sent the sample to find.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to carry the suspicious powder through the Wetlands to Ashlan Stonesmirk.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the strange-smelling powder to Ashlan Stonesmirk.",["sourceHash"]="85ca4f58f8ae6a38af068123cebfcd0fe7af5f55ae0131cb2b0fda80a4ab7227",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[162]={["aftermath"]="Gracina named the insects silithid and described them as tools of a danger reaching both factions. The report had acquired a historical context the surveyors lacked.",["atomIDs"]={"162:description:1-90","162:description:95-150","162:description:153-267","162:description:270-394","162:description:397-416","162:description:421-499","162:objective:1-68"},["bridge"]="Fizzledowser had received the urgent analysis. A copied report was bound for Gracina Spiritmight in Darnassus, whose studies might explain the wider threat.",["bridgeFrom"]=113,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"162:completion:1-14","162:completion:16-64","162:completion:67-117","162:completion:122-254","162:completion:257-306","162:completion:309-445","162:completion:450-497"},["opening"]="Gracina Spiritmight's knowledge of unusual life and history made her Fizzledowser's proposed expert in Darnassus. His copied report needed to reach her before a response to the insect threat could be understood.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to take the Insect Analysis Report to Gracina.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Insect Analysis Report to Gracina Spiritmight.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="efb8fb8b657513aa7030b3849e75d1dbc1e3c37e014f606063f3dc4003768aee",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[163]={["atomIDs"]={"163:description:1-36","163:description:38-110","163:description:112-232","163:description:237-334","163:objective:1-37"},["opening"]="Elaine Carevin had heard Calor's reports of moving shadows and a light among Raven Hill's buildings. She wanted someone to discover what lay behind the apparent haunting.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to investigate the reported haunting at Raven Hill.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Jitters while investigating Raven Hill.",["sourceHash"]="bc37f6b2b223b68303e27517aaca2fa37244ec2859fe591ba8996fd8150f194c",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[164]={["atomIDs"]={"164:description:71-140","164:description:145-241","164:description:243-281","164:objective:1-29"},["opening"]="Sven's small company camped at Duskwood's northwestern edge. Elaine Carevin said they could not spare anyone to collect provisions, so supplies from town needed another carrier.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to take the Carevin supplies to Sven.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the supplies to Sven.",["sourceHash"]="41c4db787cfad4a9adb9aa77bfa5d10ef636808cf5dd1f4048fbd521873b3d32",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[165]={["atomIDs"]={"165:description:1-130","165:description:132-212","165:description:214-261","165:objective:1-59"},["opening"]="An elderly customer had stopped coming into town for supplies, worrying Elaine Carevin. She remembered his shack overlooking Raven Hill cemetery and asked that someone check on him.",["pending"]="{actor} would visit the old man near Raven Hill cemetery.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} checked on Abercrombie at the shack near the cemetery.",["sourceHash"]="be4d286a72e2d8888551b0eb46a0a5b8e6fa191e522849c82ab9572d5dc1ae02",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
